<title>USA: Technology Solutions completes HRM Resources buy.</title>
<headline>Technology Solutions completes HRM Resources buy.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Technology Solutions Co said Wednesday it completed its previously announced acquisition of HRM Resources Inc, a technology implementation firm in New York.</p>
<p>The stock swap involved Technology Solutions shares valued at $12.5 million, the buyer said.</p>
<p>Tehcnology Solutions provides business and technology consulting services.</p>
<p>Its shares were trading up 5/8 Wednesday at 24-3/4.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
